Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.16,0:22:25.78,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}時間が過ぎてゆく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.16,0:22:25.78,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}時光緩緩流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.78,0:22:27.79,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}明日も　ここで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.78,0:22:27.79,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}願明天在此地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.79,0:22:30.62,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}同じ場所で会えるように
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.79,0:22:30.62,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}再度與你相會
