Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:47.43,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}胸の内を今も
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.22,0:22:47.43,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}我如今的內心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:49.52,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}見えない様にと　
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.43,0:22:49.52,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}依舊不願被人窺探
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.52,0:22:52.64,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}覆い隠した
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.52,0:22:52.64,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}於是層層掩藏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.64,0:22:54.65,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}なんでも良いけれど
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.64,0:22:54.65,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}即便說著不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.65,0:22:57.48,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}一枚隔てたら
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.65,0:22:57.48,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}但若是咫尺相隔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.48,0:23:01.82,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}本音がきけるから
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.48,0:23:01.82,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}就能聽到我的心曲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:04.49,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}フィクション／ノンフィクション
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.82,0:23:04.49,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}虛構與真實
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:07.03,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}事実も中にはあるかもしれない？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.49,0:23:07.03,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}或許謊言中夾雜著幾分真心？
